        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>It&#39;s just over a month since the most recent post on the <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/journals/gtg-business-blog\">GTG Business Blog</a>. I know that there are multiple good reasons for that blog, and many other things, being quiet for that month. I hope that it&#39;ll start up again soon.</p><p>If you&#39;re looking for topic suggestions...</p><p>I&#39;d be interested in the reasoning and timing of the move from Kickstarter to DIY pre-orders for Vengence. I think I&#39;ve seen bits and pieces on this, but would love to see the decision put in the context of the KS experience from the GTG perspective, and thoughts on future releases.</p><p>Hope everyone&#39;s 2014 has started well,</p><p>Andrew</p>",
